Title: The Transfer Student

INT. CLASSROOM - AFTERNOON

[[scene: arrival]]

The door slides open. Aiko steps in, satchel clutched to her chest, as thirty pairs of eyes turn toward her.

AIKO
Um... hello. I'm Aiko. I just transferred in.

She bows, a little too deeply.

[[choice: Introduce yourself to the class -> greet]]
[[choice: Hurry to an empty seat -> observe]]

INT. CLASSROOM - AFTERNOON

[[scene: greet]]

Aiko straightens, takes a breath, and meets the room with a small, certain smile.

AIKO
I hope we can all get along this year.

[[next: ending]]

INT. CLASSROOM - EVENING

[[scene: observe]]

Aiko slips into the seat by the window and watches the courtyard until the room empties.

[[next: ending]]

INT. CLASSROOM - EVENING

[[scene: ending]]

The last of the light fades from the windows. A new chapter begins.
